\f1\b \cf8 \cb3 Solar Generation Analysis:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \cb3 \
We are working with solar generation data in Germany from 2015 to July 2023. Here, we analyze the percentage of solar generation compared to the total energy generation. As observed from the plot, the proportion has been steadily increasing over time.\cb1 \

\f1\b \cf8 \cb3 Annual Solar Radiation and Capacity:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \cb3 \
In this plot, we present the annual average solar radiation from 2001 to 2020, along with the installed capacities up to 2023. Based on the two figures, we can conclude that solar generation capacity is highly correlated with installed capacity.\cb1 \

